{"nodes": [{"id": "reports_hag_46_accounts_schema_drift", "label": "HAG-46 report: accounts schema drift (9 tables folded into schema-v4.sql)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "reports/HAG-46-accounts-schema-drift.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "reports_hag_46_schema_v4_sql", "label": "schema-v4.sql (+171 lines, additive)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "reports/HAG-46-accounts-schema-drift.md", "source_location": "Maa-Baglamkhi-Resort-Backend/schema-v4.sql", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Makes schema-v4.sql sufficient on its own so the 9 accounts tables exist whether or not any model runs \u2014 a clean install of schema-v4.sql alone previously produced 72 of the live 130 tables, so the app schema only existed because models silently ran their ensureSchema() on the live db."}, {"id": "reports_hag_46_migration_20261018", "label": "migrations/20261018_accounts_schema_drift.sql (additive, IF NOT EXISTS guarded)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "reports/HAG-46-accounts-schema-drift.md", "source_location": "Maa-Baglamkhi-Resort-Backend/migrations/20261018_accounts_schema_drift.sql", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every statement is CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS with no DROP/ALTER/MODIFY/UPDATE/DELETE/TRUNCATE, so re-running cannot remove or alter anything; idempotency proven by loading into scratch databases repeatedly."}, {"id": "reports_hag_46_accounts_expansion_model", "label": "AccountsExpansionModel.js (unwired DDL for 9 accounts tables)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "reports/HAG-46-accounts-schema-drift.md", "source_location": "Maa-Baglamkhi-Resort-Backend/src/models/AccountsExpansionModel.js", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Its ensureSchema() DDL defines purchase_orders, vendor_payment_records, petty_cash_entries, gst_return_records, profit_center_entries, account_bank_ledgers, payroll_records, payment_gateway_settings and bank_reconciliation_matches, but nothing in src/ calls it or requires it \u2014 it is dead DDL; app.js's ensureAccountsExpansionSchema alias silently ran the wrong model (TransactionsModel), which is why the drift was invisible."}, {"id": "reports_hag_46_ensure_accounts_expansion_schema", "label": "ensureAccountsExpansionSchema alias (silently wrong)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "reports/HAG-46-accounts-schema-drift.md", "source_location": "Maa-Baglamkhi-Resort-Backend/src/app.js:34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "app.js:34 imports ensureAccountsExpansionSchema from TransactionsModel, whose ensureSchema() creates only the transactions table; it returned success so no one noticed the 9 accounts tables were never provisioned \u2014 the correct alias is a two-line change owned by the accounts card, out of scope for this ticket."}, {"id": "reports_hag_46_transactions_model", "label": "TransactionsModel.js (ensureSchema creates only transactions)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "reports/HAG-46-accounts-schema-drift.md", "source_location": "Maa-Baglamkhi-Resort-Backend/src/models/TransactionsModel.js:8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "reports_hag_46_accounts_routes", "label": "accountsRoutes.js (50 routes, local ensureAccountsSchema ALTERs payments)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "reports/HAG-46-accounts-schema-drift.md", "source_location": "Maa-Baglamkhi-Resort-Backend/src/routes/accountsRoutes.js:79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "reports_hag_46_accounts_transactions_table", "label": "accounts_transactions table (unused by any route)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reports/HAG-46-accounts-schema-drift.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A 9th absence from schema-v4.sql defined in AccountsModel.js, not AccountsExpansionModel.js; 'accounts' as a table does not exist \u2014 the live v4 ledger is transactions + transaction_entries + chart_of_accounts."}, {"id": "reports_hag_46_petty_cash_501", "label": "6 petty-cash/GST write routes return 501 by design", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "reports/HAG-46-accounts-schema-drift.md", "source_location": "src/controller/accountsController.js", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Petty cash and GST writes are intentionally refused: they are derived read-only views over the v4 payments and invoices tables; creating petty_cash_entries/gst_return_records tables would not fix the routes \u2014 the 501 is a deliberate code decision that pre-dates this ticket."}, {"id": "reports_hag_46_migration_20261016", "label": "migrations/20261016_close_schema_drift.sql (does not cover any accounts table)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "reports/HAG-46-accounts-schema-drift.md", "source_location": "Maa-Baglamkhi-Resort-Backend/migrations/20261016_close_schema_drift.sql", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "reports_hag_46_accounts_schema_drift", "target": "reports_hag_46_schema_v4_sql", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "reports/HAG-46-accounts-schema-drift.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "reports_hag_46_accounts_schema_drift", "target": "reports_hag_46_migration_20261018", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "reports/HAG-46-accounts-schema-drift.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "reports_hag_46_accounts_schema_drift", "target": "reports_hag_46_accounts_expansion_model", "relation": "refe